WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
Everyone knows that Mr. Jingliang is a cold figure in the medical field.

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,080
But I never expected it

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,640
My sister has only been home for a day

4
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:08,000
I can actually make the hard old man hit my legs

5
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:11,570
Can my legs really be cured?

6
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:17,670
Can you still go skiing in the future? Yoyo

7
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:26,670
Then we won’t bother you. I’ll help you walk your dog, Yoyo.

8
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:30,580
You are quite kind and safe

9
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,300
You are actually willing to come out

10
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,740
Beautiful sister meets again

11
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,220
You are more beautiful today than yesterday

12
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:38,940
Wow beautiful sister

13
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:42,180
Your eyelashes are so long too.

14
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,380
beautiful sister

15
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,380
Your mouth is red

16
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:51,050
Beautiful sister, kiss
